meta {
  name: Client App Settings
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/client/settings
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Locale: {{locale}}
}

docs {
  # Client App Settings

  Public endpoint. Returns the app rules/terms of use configured in the admin
  panel (Настройки → Настройки приложения). Show this before or during
  registration — no auth required.

  This is the only rules endpoint: the master-side copy
  (`GET /api/v1/master/settings`) was removed, both roles read this one.

  **Response 200:**
  ```json
  {
    "data": { "content": "<h1>Правила</h1><p>Текст правил пользования...</p>" }
  }
  ```

  `content` is raw HTML — render it in a WebView or parse it. Returns an empty
  string `""` when no rules have been configured yet.
}
